      "content": "talking doesn't really change the reality of it though. no matter how much i vent, tomorrow i still have to wake up and be the person they want me to be. it's like being trapped in a room where the walls just keep getting closer every single day. i don't want to \"find a way\" to fit into their world... i just want the walls to stop closing in. i just want everything to be quiet and for the pressure to finally just stop.",
